This package contains code from webtransport-go v0.13.0
(github.com/quic-go/webtransport-go), MIT licensed; see LICENSE. go-qrdb
patches it to build against quic-go v0.65.0, to bound stream buffering before
a session is established, and to bound each established session's queue of
streams waiting to be accepted; README.md lists the patches.
